scenario: USBC-LINK-01
title: One-cable link to another computer
area: Network
rows: F-DEV-10, F-DEV-18
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A USB-C (or Thunderbolt) cable that carries data and a second computer with a USB-C port.
step: Connect the cable between the two computers.
expect: Within thirty seconds the Developer mode page, Connect over USB-C, shows a check list.
clause: F-DEV-18.checks
step: Read each line of the check list.
expect: Each line is green or says in plain words why not (for example the cable carries only power).
clause: F-DEV-18.words
step: If every line is green press Pair and confirm on both computers.
expect: The other computer is seen by name and a speed is reported.
clause: F-DEV-10.pair
